<item><title>South Africa welcomes ICJ ruling holding Myanmar responsible for genocide</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/south-africa-welcomes-icj-ruling-holding-myanmar-2ba8b2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/south-africa-welcomes-icj-ruling-holding-myanmar-2ba8b2/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The court ordered Myanmar to provide restitution and compensation to Rohingya people and guarantees that the atrocities will not be repeated.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:02:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
